{"metadata":{"title":"Interaction — Pinch","roleHeading":"Sample Code","role":"sampleCode","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Preview","level":2,"text":"Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"The-patch","level":2,"text":"The patch"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Origami drives this with an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"type":"text","text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reads the pinch, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".spring"},{"type":"text","text":" animates the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"type":"text","text":" row in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"How-its-built","level":2,"text":"How it’s built"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@GestureState"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Behavior","level":2,"text":"Behavior"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking your fingers continuously."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Downloads","level":2,"text":"Downloads"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode sample","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/pr-288\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" — the runnable project (same as the button above)."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift source"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — the single source file to read."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami source","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/origami.design\/public\/origami_files\/patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.origami","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}]}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Pinch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"title":"Patterns","identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"anchor":"Patterns","generated":true}],"sampleCodeDownload":{"kind":"sampleDownload","action":{"type":"reference","overridingTitle":"Download Xcode sample","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/swamikit.github.io\/swami\/pr-288\/downloads\/Interaction_Pinch.zip"}},"abstract":[{"text":"Pinch a shape to scale it. Past a threshold it pops to an enlarged size with a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"spring; pinch back in and it pops home.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_pinch"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"article","references":{"https://github.com/swamikit/swami/blob/development/app/Swami/Patterns/Interaction_Pinch.swift":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Swami\/Patterns\/Interaction_Pinch.swift","titleInlineContent":[{"code":"Interaction_Pinch.swift","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/swamikit\/swami\/blob\/development\/app\/Sw